tSeason\": \"October - February\",\n    \"description\": \"UNESCO ruins of the Vijayanagara Empire.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Leh Ladakh\",\n    \"location\": \"Ladakh, India\",\n    \"category\": \"Adventure\",\n    \"price\": 32000,\n    \"rating\": 4.9,\n    \"duration\": 7,\n    \"bestSeason\": \"June - September\",\n    \"description\": \"High-altitude passes, monasteries and road trips.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Rishikesh Rafting\",\n    \"location\": \"Uttarakhand, India\",\n    \"category\": \"Adventure\",\n    \"price\": 7000,\n    \"rating\": 4.1,\n    \"duration\": 3,\n    \"bestSeason\": \"September - June\",\n    \"description\": \"White-water rafting, bungee jumping and yoga.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Jim Corbett National Park\",\n    \"location\": \"Uttarakhand, India\",\n    \"category\": \"Wildlife\",\n    \"price\": 10500,\n    \"rating\": 4,\n    \"duration\": 3,\n    \"bestSeason\": \"November - June\",\n    \"description\": \"Tiger reserve with jeep safaris through the forest.\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Varanasi Ghats\",\n    \"location\": \"Uttar Pradesh, India\",\n    \"category\": \"Spiritual\",\n    \"price\": 8000,\n    \"rating\": 4.5,\n    \"duration\": 3,\n    \"bestSeason\": \"October - March\",\n    \"description\": \"Evening Ganga aarti and ancient temples.\"\n  }\n]",
